{"unit_id":"tag:06SN:statement","translation":"下面是一个更明确的 <MATH_0001> 的例子，如引理 <REF_0001> 中所述。设 <MATH_0002> 是素数（prime number），并令 <MATH_0003>。令 <MATH_0004>，并令 <MATH_0005>，其中映射（map）<MATH_0006> 由 <MATH_0007> 给出。则可取\n<MATH_0008>\n在此例中无法做得“更好”，即无法逼近 <MATH_0009>，使用更小的光滑（smooth）对象（object）（属于 <MATH_0010>）来实现这一点（可以论证，<MATH_0011> 的维数（dimension）必须至少为 <MATH_0012>，因为映射（map）<MATH_0013> 是满射（surjective）的）。后文将更详细地讨论这一现象。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"prime number","target_term":"素数"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"prime number","target_term":"素数","context":"显式例子的特征，待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"例子中的映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"逼近的性质，待决。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"逼近对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数","context":"更小对象的限制，待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"维数下界，待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06HV:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n下文经常考虑纤维积（fibre products）<MATH_0001>，针对范畴（category）<MATH_0002> 中的环（rings）。例 <REF_0001> 已表明，这样的纤维积（fibre product）并不一定是 <MATH_0003> 的对象（object）。不过，在下文几乎所有情形中，两个映射（maps）<MATH_0004> 中有一个是满射（surjective）的，因而 <MATH_0005> 将成为 <MATH_0006> 的对象（object），这是由引理 <REF_0002> 得到的。使用这一结论时将不再说明。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n以 <MATH_0007> 表示 <MATH_0008> 上的对偶数（dual numbers）环（ring）。更一般地，对一个 <MATH_0009> 向量空间（vector space）<MATH_0010>，以 <MATH_0011> 表示 <MATH_0012> 代数（algebra），其底层向量空间（vector space）为 <MATH_0013>，乘法（multiplication）由 <MATH_0014> 给出。当 <MATH_0015> 时，<MATH_0016> 是 <MATH_0017> 上的对偶数（dual numbers）环（ring）。对任意有限维（finite dimensional）的 <MATH_0018> 向量空间（vector space）<MATH_0019>，环（ring）<MATH_0020> 属于 <MATH_0021>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"dual numbers","target_term":"对偶数"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"multiplication","target_term":"乘法"},{"source_term":"dual numbers","target_term":"对偶数"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"finite dimensional","target_term":"有限维"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"Schlessinger 条件的输入，待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"环的范畴，待决。"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环","context":"纤维积的输入，待决。"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term